## Face out, world in

Contemporary self-portraiture keeps refusing the face. The mirror shows the sky, the room, the street—everything the person is standing inside of.

## The diary as archive

Shoot the same reflection daily and the images stop being about you. They become a record of weather, light, and how long you kept going.
